#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:67 imageplugin_restoration.cpp:62
msgid "Photograph Restoration"
msgstr "Foto-Wedderherstellen"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:69
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to restore a photograph."
msgstr "En digiKam-Moduul för't Wedderherstellen vun Fotos"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:75
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autor un Pleger"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:78
msgid "CImg library"
msgstr "\"CImg\"-Bibliotheek"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:81
msgid "Feedback and plugin polishing"
msgstr "Torüchmellen un Moduul-Överarbeiden"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:92
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "Vörinstellen"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:100
msgid "Visit CImg library website"
msgstr "Nettsiet vun de \"CImg\"-Bibliotheek besöken"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:102
msgid "Filtering type:"
msgstr "Filter-Typ:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:104
msgid "None"
msgstr "Keen"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:105
msgid "Reduce Uniform Noise"
msgstr "Eenheitlich Rusen minnern"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:106
msgid "Reduce JPEG Artefacts"
msgstr "JPEG-Artefakten minnern"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:107
msgid "Reduce Texturing"
msgstr "Texturen minnern"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:108
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the filter preset to use for photograph restoration:"
"<p><b>None</b>: Most common values. Puts settings to default."
"<p><b>Reduce Uniform Noise</b>: reduce small image artefacts like sensor noise."
"<p><b>Reduce JPEG Artefacts</b>: reduce large image artefacts like JPEG "
"compression mosaic."
"<p><b>Reduce Texturing</b>: reduce image artefacts like paper texture or Moire "
"patterns of a scanned image."
"<p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du en vörinstellt Filter för't Foto-Wedderherstellen utsöken:"
"<p><b>Keen</b>: Tomehrst bruukte Weerten, sett allens op de Vörinstellen."
"<p><b>Eenheitlich Rusen minnern</b>: minnert lütte Artefakten, as t.B. "
"Sensor-Rusen."
"<p><b>JPEG-Artefakten minnern</b>: minnert grote Artefakten, as t.B. "
"JPEG-Komprimeermosaiken."
"<p><b>Texturen minnern</b>: minnert Artefakten as t.B. Papeer-Texturen oder "
"Moiree-Mustern vun en inleest Bild."
"<p>"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:124
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr "Weekmaken"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:126
msgid "Detail preservation:"
msgstr "Enkelheiten wohren:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:130
msgid ""
"<p>Preservation of details to set the sharpening level of the small features in "
"the target image. Higher values leave details sharp."
msgstr ""
"<p>\"Enkelheiten wohren\" leggt de Scharpteek-Stoop för lütte Objekten binnen "
"dat Teelbild fast. Grötter Weerten maakt disse Enkelheiten scharp."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:136
msgid "Anisotropy:"
msgstr "Richtenafhangigkeit:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:140
msgid ""
"<p>Anisotropic (directional) modifier of the details. Keep it small for "
"Gaussian noise."
msgstr ""
"<p>Richtenafhangen Modifikator för Enkelheiten. Laat em lütt, vun wegen dat "
"Gauß'sche Rusen."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:144
msgid "Smoothing:"
msgstr "Weekmaken:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:148
msgid ""
"<p>Total smoothing power: if Detail Factor sets the relative smoothing and "
"Gradient Factor the direction, Time Step sets the overall effect."
msgstr ""
"<p>Heel Weekmaak-Stärk: Wenn de Enkelheiten-Faktor dat relative Weekmaken "
"fastleggt, un de Övergangfaktor de Richt, denn leggt de Tietschritt den helen "
"Effekt fast."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:153
msgid "Regularity:"
msgstr "Regelmatigkeit:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:157
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls the smoothing regularity of the target image. Do not use "
"an high value here, or the target image will be completely blurred."
msgstr ""
"<p>Disse Weert stüert de Weekmaak-Regelmatigkeit vun dat Teelbild. Bruuk hier "
"keen hogen Weert, wiel sünst dat Teelbild heel verwischt warrt."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:163
msgid "Iterations:"
msgstr "Wedderhalen:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:167
msgid "<p>Sets the number of times the filter is applied on the target image."
msgstr "<p>Leggt fast, wo faken de Filter op dat Teelbild anwendt warrt."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:175
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Verwiedert Instellen"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:177
msgid "Angular step:"
msgstr "Winkelschritt:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:181
msgid ""
"<p>Set here the angular integration step in degrees in analogy to anisotropy."
msgstr ""
"<p>Leggt den Integratschoon-Winkelschritt in Graad fast, analoog to de "
"Richtenafhangigkeit."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:185
msgid "Integral step:"
msgstr "Integraalschritt:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:189
msgid "<p>Set here the spatial integral step. Stay below 1."
msgstr "<p>Leggt den Ruum-Integraalschritt fast. Bliev ünner 1."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:193
msgid "Gaussian:"
msgstr "Gauß'sch:"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:197
msgid "<p>Set here the precision of the Gaussian function."
msgstr "<p>Leggt de Nauigkeit vun de Gauß'sch Funkschoon fast."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:201
msgid "Use linear interpolation"
msgstr "Lineaar Estemeren bruken"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:202
msgid "<p>Enable this option to quench the last bit of quality (slow)."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak disse Optschoon an, wenn Du dat leste Beten an Gööd rutquetschen wullt "
"(langsam)."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:205
msgid "Normalize photograph"
msgstr "Foto normaliseren"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:206
msgid "<p>Enable this option to process an output image normalization."
msgstr "<p>Maak disse Optschoon an, wenn Du dat Utgaavbild normaliseren wullt."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:394
msgid "Restoration"
msgstr "Wedderherstellen"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:402
msgid "Photograph Restoration Settings File to Load"
msgstr "Instellendatei för't Wedderherstellen laden"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:415
msgid "\"%1\" is not a Photograph Restoration settings text file."
msgstr "\"%1\" is keen Text-Instellendatei för't Wedderherstellen."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:437
msgid "Cannot load settings from the Photograph Restoration text file."
msgstr "Instellen laat sik nich ut de Textdatei för't Wedderherstellen laden."

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:446
msgid "Photograph Restoration Settings File to Save"
msgstr "Instellendatei för't Wedderherstellen sekern"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:468
msgid "Cannot save settings to the Photograph Restoration text file."
msgstr "Instellen laat sik nich na de Textdatei för't Wedderherstellen sekern."

#: imageplugin_restoration.cpp:42
msgid "Restoration..."
msgstr "Wedderherstellen..."

